{"ref":"character:megalo-death","lead":[{"k":"p","c":[{"i":"Animated-Alucard.gif","w":40,"h":34}]},{"k":"p","c":["DLC Content (Ode to Castlevania)"]},{"k":"p","c":["This article primarily features content only available in DLC, which may not be available in all copies of the game."]},{"k":"p","c":["Megalo Death is a secret playable character from the Ode to Castlevania DLC of Vampire Survivors. His starting weapon is the ",{"i":"Sprite-Death_Spiral.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"weapon:death-spiral"}," ",{"t":"Death Spiral","r":"weapon:death-spiral"},", but he also has the option of starting with the ",{"i":"Sprite-Ebony_Diabologue.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"weapon:ebony-diabologue"}," ",{"t":"Ebony Diabologue","r":"weapon:ebony-diabologue"}," if it has been unlocked."]}],"infobox":[{"title":"Character","rows":[{"label":"Release","cells":[["31 October 2024 (Update)"]]},{"label":"Alias","cells":[["Death"]]},{"label":"Character ID","cells":[["TP_DEATH_MEGA"]]},{"label":"Skin ID","cells":[["DEFAULT"]]},{"label":"Controller","cells":[["TP_MegaloDeath_Character"]]},{"label":"Starting weapon","cells":[[{"i":"Sprite-Death_Spiral.png","w":16,"h":16,"r":"weapon:death-spiral"}," ",{"t":"Death Spiral","r":"weapon:death-spiral"}]]},{"label":"Hidden weapon","cells":[[{"i":"Sprite-Death_Hand.png","w":16,"h":14,"r":"weapon:death-hand"}," ",{"t":"Death Hand","r":"weapon:death-hand"}]]},{"label":"Unlocked by","cells":[["Unleash maximised Death on the Castle while holding the soul-stealing stones."]]},{"label":"Cost","cells":[[{"i":"Sprite-Gold_Coin.png","w":10,"h":10}," 16,650"]]},{"label":"Secret","cells":[["Yes"]]},{"label":"Ignores walls","cells":[["No"]]},{"label":"Theme","cells":[[{"i":"Music-Ode_to_Castlevania-Castlevania_Harmony_of_Despair.png","w":20,"h":20}," \"Dance of Illusions\""]]}]},{"title":"Initial stats","rows":[{"label":"Max Health","cells":[["400"]]},{"label":"Armor","cells":[["+2"]]},{"label":"Move Speed","cells":[["+100%"]]},{"label":"Might","cells":[["+250%"]]},{"label":"Cooldown","cells":[["-20%"]]},{"label":"Greed","cells":[["+100%"]]},{"label":"Reroll","cells":[["+10"]]},{"label":"Skip","cells":[["+10"]]},{"label":"Banish","cells":[["+10"]]}]}],"sections":[{"id":"unlocking","title":"Unlocking","blocks":[{"k":"p","c":[{"i":"Sprite-Forbidden_Scrolls_of_Morbane.png","w":21,"h":21,"a":"A sprite icon representing Forbidden Scrolls of Morbane linking to Forbidden Scrolls of Morbane","r":"relic:forbidden-scrolls-of-morbane"}," \"Unleash maximised Death on the Castle while holding the soul-stealing stones.\"\nFull unlock method hidden. Click \"Show Details\" to unhide."]},{"k":"p","c":["After obtaining both the ",{"i":"Sprite-Ebony_and_Crimson_Stones.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"relic:ebony-and-crimson-stones"}," ",{"t":"Ebony and Crimson Stones","r":"relic:ebony-and-crimson-stones"}," and the ",{"i":"Sprite-Pile_of_Secrets.png","w":20,"h":24,"r":"relic:pile-of-secrets"}," ",{"t":"Pile of Secrets","r":"relic:pile-of-secrets"},", the player must start a run in ",{"t":"Ode to Castlevania","r":"stage:ode-to-castlevania-stage"}," while playing as ",{"i":"Sprite-Death.png","w":24,"h":23,"r":"character:death-character"}," ",{"t":"Death","r":"character:death-character"}," and kill a total of 100,000 enemies or more in a single run. Doing this unlocks Megalo Death as a playable character."]},{"k":"p","c":["Once unlocked, Megalo Death can be purchased for ",{"i":"Sprite-Gold_Coin.png","w":10,"h":10}," 16,650, which scales with other characters purchased."]},{"k":"p","c":["Alternatively, Megalo Death can be unlocked in the ",{"i":"Sprite-Forbidden_Scrolls_of_Morbane.png","w":16,"h":16,"r":"relic:forbidden-scrolls-of-morbane"}," ",{"t":"Forbidden Scrolls of Morbane","r":"relic:forbidden-scrolls-of-morbane"}," by casting the spell \"embracethereaper\"."]}],"subs":[]},{"id":"passive-bonuses","title":"Passive bonuses","blocks":[{"k":"p","c":["Megalo Death starts with the following bonuses:"]},{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":["+300 ",{"i":"Sprite-Max_Health.png","w":24,"h":23,"r":"powerup:max-health"}," ",{"t":"Max Health","r":"powerup:max-health"}]},{"c":["+2 ",{"i":"Sprite-Armor.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"powerup:armor-stat"}," ",{"t":"Armor","r":"powerup:armor-stat"}]},{"c":["+100% ",{"i":"Sprite-Move_Speed.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"powerup:move-speed"}," ",{"t":"Move Speed","r":"powerup:move-speed"}]},{"c":["+250% ",{"i":"Sprite-Might.png","w":18,"h":24,"r":"powerup:might"}," ",{"t":"Might","r":"powerup:might"}]},{"c":["-20% ",{"i":"Sprite-Cooldown.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"powerup:cooldown"}," ",{"t":"Cooldown","r":"powerup:cooldown"}]},{"c":["+100% ",{"i":"Sprite-Greed.png","w":24,"h":20,"r":"powerup:greed"}," ",{"t":"Greed","r":"powerup:greed"}]},{"c":["+10 ",{"i":"Sprite-Reroll.png","w":22,"h":24,"r":"powerup:reroll"}," ",{"t":"Reroll","r":"powerup:reroll"}]},{"c":["+10 ",{"i":"Sprite-Skip.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"powerup:skip"}," ",{"t":"Skip","r":"powerup:skip"}]},{"c":["+10 ",{"i":"Sprite-Banish.png","w":24,"h":21,"r":"powerup:banish"}," ",{"t":"Banish","r":"powerup:banish"}]}]},{"k":"p","c":["Megalo Death is the permanent transformation ",{"i":"Sprite-Death.png","w":24,"h":23,"r":"character:death-character"}," ",{"t":"Death","r":"character:death-character"}," receives upon reaching level 80. This transformation grants Death the ",{"i":"Sprite-Death_Hand.png","w":24,"h":21,"r":"weapon:death-hand"}," ",{"t":"Death Hand","r":"weapon:death-hand"}," as a hidden weapon, which are two giant skeletal hands that move in tandem with him and create large cracks in the ground that shake the screen and deal 65 base damage to enemies."]},{"k":"p","c":["He cannot die but instead disappears at the time limit and ending the run automatically, similar to ",{"i":"Sprite-Megalo_Menya_Moonspell.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"character:megalo-menya-moonspell"}," ",{"t":"Megalo Menya Moonspell","r":"character:megalo-menya-moonspell"}," ",{"i":"Sprite-DLCBadge-LegacyOfTheMoonSpell.png","w":12,"h":12,"a":"This content requires the Legacy of the Moonspell DLC to access"}," and ",{"i":"Sprite-Ghost_Lino.png","w":18,"h":24,"r":"character:ghost-lino"}," ",{"t":"Ghost Lino","r":"character:ghost-lino"}," ",{"i":"Sprite-DLCBadge-EmergencyMeeting.png","w":12,"h":12,"a":"This content requires the Emergency Meeting DLC to access"},"."]},{"k":"p","c":["Megalo Death can find special Ode to Castlevania pickups from light sources."]}],"subs":[]},{"id":"trivia","title":"Trivia","blocks":[{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":["Megalo Death's death animation cycles through the Gate Key icons."]},{"c":["Megalo Death closely resembles Death's appearance as a ",{"i":"Sprite-Death_(boss).png","w":24,"h":15}," boss, but only includes his head and hands."]},{"c":["Much like the description of Death, Megalo Death's description references both the description of ",{"i":"Sprite-Mask_of_the_Red_Death.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"character:mask-of-the-red-death"}," ",{"t":"Mask of the Red Death","r":"character:mask-of-the-red-death"}," and the 1842 short story ",{"t":"The Masque of the Red Death","x":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/The_Masque_of_the_Red_Death"}," by ",{"t":"Edgar Allan Poe","x":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Edgar_Allan_Poe"},"."]}]}],"subs":[]},{"id":"gallery","title":"Gallery","blocks":[{"k":"gallery","items":[{"i":"Sprite-Megalo_Death.png","w":112,"h":120,"c":["Megalo Death's sprite"]},{"i":"Unlock-Death.png","w":120,"h":120,"c":["Secrets menu icon"]}]}],"subs":[]},{"id":"update-history","title":"Update history","blocks":[{"k":"p","c":["This information has been manually compiled. Some updates may not be included yet."]},{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":["update 11 February 2026 (Update):"],"sub":{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":["Fixed Secrets for OTC Megalo characters show up before getting the Pile of Secrets"]}]}}]}],"subs":[]},{"id":"external-links","title":"External links","blocks":[{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":[{"t":"Death","x":"https://castlevania.fandom.com/wiki/Death"}," on the ",{"t":" Castlevania Wiki","x":"https://castlevania.fandom.com/"}]}]}],"sub